---
source: crates/m2-server-core/tests/training.rs
expression: h.log
---
-- level 30: 29 skill points; the skills' quickslots cleared, the book's kept
@1000 conn#4 sends UseItem 1:0
   -> send conn#4 ItemSet 1:0 3200x1
   -> event: conn#4: character 1 forgot its skills
   -> send conn#4 QuickSlotCleared 0
   -> send conn#4 QuickSlotCleared 2
   -> send conn#4 SkillGroup 0
   -> send conn#4 PointsChanged 28=29
   -> send conn#4 Skills
   -> send conn#4 Chat kind=1 vid=0 "You have forgotten your skills. Choose again: /skillgroup 1 or 2"
-- nothing left to forget
@1000 conn#4 sends UseItem 1:0
   -> send conn#4 Chat kind=1 vid=0 "You have nothing to forget."
-- a book now: no group
@1000 conn#4 sends UseItem 1:1
   -> send conn#4 Chat kind=1 vid=0 "Choose a skill group first: /skillgroup 1 or 2"
